repository-code: "https://github.com/SBBCS-UFRO/Moleku"
repository-artifact: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22255681"
url: "https://github.com/SBBCS-UFRO/Moleku"

abstract: >-
  Moleku is an open-source desktop cheminformatics platform for reproducible
  virtual library generation, filtering, prioritization, and export through
  curated multicomponent reaction workflows. Version 1.0.0 supports Biginelli,
  Groebke-Blackburn-Bienayme (GBB), and Gewald reactions and integrates reagent
  quality control, reaction-based molecular enumeration, molecular
  standardization, physicochemical descriptor calculation, configurable
  drug-likeness rules, structural-alert assessment, InChIKey-based
  deduplication, the Moleku heuristic physicochemical prioritization score,
  local ADMET analysis, and research-oriented export workflows.

keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - multicomponent reactions
  - virtual library generation
  - molecular enumeration
  - molecular prioritization
  - drug-likeness
  - ADMET
  - RDKit
  - reproducibility
  - early drug discovery
